&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As Manager, Finance Business Partner, you will work closely with an operations-focused team to translate strategy into operating plans, budgets, forecasts, and informed business decisions. You will connect customer demand and organizational capacity to unit economics, strengthen forecast accuracy, and help leaders balance service commitments, profitability, and customer outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for an analytical, business-minded finance leader who is equally comfortable building models, developing dashboards, and advising senior stakeholders. The successful candidate will turn financial and operational variances into clear insights, recommend practical actions, and help business partners strengthen their own financial decision-making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
