&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate is equally comfortable building complex data models, creating executive-level dashboards, partnering with senior leaders to influence business decisions, and building an elite analytics capability. Over time, this person will be expected to develop, lead, and raise the standard for a high-performing analytics team that delivers trusted insights, scalable reporting, and measurable business impact across the GTM organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
