&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;In a Test Engineer II role you will document test scenarios, automate test cases, and learn to develop solutions that improve our test automation framework. A typical day might include reviewing automation runs and addressing failures, documenting test cases to cover a new product or feature and creating new automated test cases. As a member of a scrum team, your collaboration and contribution to the team will be critical to our success.&lt;/p&gt;
