&lt;p&gt;Responsible for the design, creation and maintenance of UI and API test scripts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Document new and maintain existing Test Cases using Xray Test Management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop new and maintain existing Cucumber Test Scripts to sustain &amp;gt;80% automated test coverage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Extend test coverage by documenting and automating test cases from production bugs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
