&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Perform other duties as assigned.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comply with all policies and standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
