&lt;p&gt;Essential Function&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration: Work closely with product managers, developers, and cross-functional teams to iterate on designs and integrate feedback throughout the development cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design Execution: Create wireframes, prototypes, and high-fidelity mockups that effectively communicate design concepts and interactions for both web and mobile platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User-Centered Design: Lead the end-to-end design process from ideation to implementation, ensuring that solutions are both user-friendly and aligned with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design Systems: Contribute to and maintain a consistent design system that reflects Businessolver’s brand standards and enhances the overall user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research &amp;amp; Analysis: Conduct user research, usability testing, and data analysis to identify pain points and opportunities for improvement. Develop personas, user journeys, and scenarios to inform design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-Driven Decision Making: Leverage quantitative and qualitative data to drive design choices, validate concepts, and iterate on solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Education:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in design, Human-Computer Interaction (HCI), or a related field (or equivalent practical experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Experience:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 3 - 5 years of professional experience in UX/UI design, preferably in enterprise software or digital products, with demonstrable experience designing for both web and mobile applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in agile or iterative development environments, with a keen understanding of how design integrates with the development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work collaboratively in a team environment and manage multiple projects simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Skills:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in design and prototyping tools such as Sketch, Figma, Adobe XD, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with user research tools and methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in conversational design, including designing for chatbots and voice-based interactions, is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data-Driven Approach:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to interpret data and apply insights to design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Portfolio:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio showcasing your expertise in user-centered design, problem-solving skills, and ability to create engaging digital experiences across web, mobile, and conversational platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Communication:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to effectively present and justify design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
